      "options": [
        "A) tan\u207b\u00b9(x/y) + ln(x\u00b2 + y\u00b2) = C",
        "B) tan\u207b\u00b9(y/x) - ln(x\u00b2 + y\u00b2) = C",
        "C) tan\u207b\u00b9(x/y) - ln(x\u00b2 + y\u00b2) = C",
        "D) tan\u207b\u00b9(y/x) + ln(x\u00b2 + y\u00b2) = C"
      ],
      "correct_option": "B",
      "explanation": "Let y = vx, then dy/dx = v + x dv/dx. Substituting: v + x dv/dx = (1 + v)/(1 - v). So x dv/dx = (1 + v)/(1 - v) - v = (1 + v - v + v\u00b2)/(1 - v) = (1 + v\u00b2)/(1 - v). Separating: (1 - v)/(1 + v\u00b2) dv = dx/x. Integrating: tan\u207b\u00b9(v) - ln(1 + v\u00b2)/2 = ln|x| + C. Substituting v = y/x: tan\u207b\u00b9(y/x) - ln(x\u00b2 + y\u00b2)/2 = ln|x| + C. Simplifying: tan\u207b\u00b9(y/x) - ln(x\u00b2 + y\u00b2) = C."
